          <ol>
            <li>What does <code>Pin.PULL_DOWN</code> do, and what would an unpressed input pin read without it?</li>
            <li>Your functions in Activities 2.5 and 2.6 never used <code>return</code>. Why did <code>measure_reaction()</code> need one?</li>
            <li>A false start does not use up one of the five attempts. Explain how the <code>while</code> loop makes that possible, and why a <code>for</code> loop would have made it harder.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <Divider variant="8" classes="my-5" />

